cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mlkem-nostd: ML-KEM (FIPS 203) in no_std Rust"
abstract: >-
  A portable, no_std, allocation-free implementation of ML-KEM (FIPS 203)
  supporting ML-KEM-512, ML-KEM-768 and ML-KEM-1024, with ACVP vectors,
  property tests, a RustCrypto cross-check, dudect timing tests and Criterion
  benchmarks. Research code; unaudited.
authors:
  - family-names: Agboola
    given-names: Abdulkabir
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Abdk4Moura/mlkem-nostd"
keywords:
  - ML-KEM
  - FIPS 203
  - Kyber
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - Rust
  - no_std
